ooc/test:
=========

This directory contains various files that excersize the translator.
They're useful when making changes or fixing bugs.  The files t1.m to
t5.m are short and quite rugged in their expressions.  If you're
chasing bugs, introduce a/some statement(s) into one of the files
and examine using 'make suite'.  The .m files are useful only when
changing the translator; their methods are non-sense.

--- brian witt, 18-April-90
